.600x338.jpg?t=1768749698"}],"short_description":"A run-based rogue-lite factory builder where middle management meets lawless Hell. Optimize production, make questionable deals, and race against the debt deadline.","steam_appid":3971650,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://forms.gle/dz5NK1FrZZbq8VCM9"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian","type":"game","website":"https://www.meltclock.co.jp/"}